OL,3,GNEWSAFunding blow puts Scotland-England
OL,4,Alandmark artwork in doubt
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a landmark artwork at the
OL,7,FScotland-England border have been put
OL,8,Fon hold after a major funder withdrew
OL,9,Fsupport.
OL,11,FAn emergency board meeting of the Star
OL,12,Fof Caledonia Trust (SCT) has agreed to
OL,13,Fpause the scheme near Gretna Green
OL,14,Funtil spring next year while it looks
OL,15,Fto fill a funding gap of #8m.
OL,17,FIt has now launched an urgent Save Our
OL,18,FStar campaign in a bid to ensure the
OL,19,Fscheme - which hoped to attract 200,000
OL,20,Fvisitors a year - can go ahead.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
