OL,3,GNEWSAFunding blow puts Scotland-England
OL,4,Alandmark artwork in doubt
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucy Houston, who chairs the SCT, said:
OL,7,F"This is a setback, but it is not the
OL,8,Fend of the Star."
